# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-GOLANG-STDOS-17905377:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          std/os symlink attack is only fixed in Go 1.25.12 / 1.26.5. This module
          is aligned to the Snyk CLI (cliv2) build toolchain, which is pinned to
          go 1.26.4. The go directive here does not determine the std library in
          the shipped binary (the CLI build toolchain does), so this can only be
          truly remediated when cliv2 bumps to go 1.26.5. Time-boxed until that
          upgrade lands.
        expires: 2026-08-13T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z
